{"points":[{"id":"msrlij1p7zlw","text":"“西周时期，打仗有固定的流程”这句话对吗？","theme":"周朝-历史","track":"历史","created":"2026-08-13","img":null,"note":"要先想是什么时期。西周时期，周朝通过“礼乐”来进行统治，吃饭有列鼎列簋制度，打仗也有固定的流程，到了东周，周朝弱小，春秋时期，诸侯国已经开始不听周朝了，到了战国，完全不听，僭越礼制。春秋时代的战争，战前有约定，战争有程序，离不开“礼”的约束，各国都坚守不成文的战争法规。宋襄公在宏水和楚国打仗的故事。春秋初期，打仗的目的不是灭国，但到了春秋后期、战国时期，战争的目的就是为了消灭对方国家，掠夺资源和人口，最后秦国统一六国。","history":[],"status":"active","due":"2026-08-16","iv":1,"mastery":1,"priority":"P1"},{"id":"msrlmrrrhinv","text":"用自己的话讲一讲《邹忌讽齐王纳谏》的故事","theme":"周朝-历史","track":"历史","created":"2026-08-13","img":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/icerenbing/sophie-srs-data/main/images/msrlmrrrhinv.jpg","note":null,"history":[],"status":"active","due":"2026-08-16","iv":1,"mastery":1,"priority":"P1"},{"id":"mswxvhcrnzj6","text":"会用英语说6:30 6:15 6:45","theme":"认识时间","track":"美国学而思数学","created":"2026-08-17 15:55","img":null,"note":"6:30 : half past six  6:15 : a quarter past（look back） 6:45: a quarter to (look forward)","status":"active","due":"2026-08-21","iv":1,"mastery":1,"history":[{"date":"2026-08-18","level":2}],"priority":"P1"},{"id":"mswzmw56bhff","text":"判断钟表时针是几，用英文说为什么","theme":"认识时间","track":"美国学而思数学","created":"2026-08-17 16:44","img":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/icerenbing/sophie-srs-data/main/images/mswzmw56bhff.jpg","note":"判断钟表是4：45 还是 5：45，为什么不是5：45，用英文说。","status":"active","due":"2026-08-17","iv":0,"mastery":0,"history":[],"priority":"P1"},{"id":"msydpcdz12v2","text":"贝赛思要求的5个好习惯","theme":"英语表达","track":"英语(课内)","created":"2026-08-18 16:06","img":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/icerenbing/sophie-srs-data/main/images/msydpcdz12v2.jpg","note":"好习惯养成：developing good habits ，strong verb：develop （造句）  \nraise your hand before speaking（before总是忘记）eyes on the teacher（eyes on 这个表达很好）","status":"active","due":"2026-08-19","iv":0,"mastery":0,"history":[{"date":"2026-08-18","level":1}],"priority":"P0"},{"id":"msyechjq5a0d","text":"look forward&creative造句,好的adj","theme":"阅读打卡--词汇使用","track":"英语(课内)","created":"2026-08-18 16:24","im